```typescript
const client = await pool.connect();
try {
  await client.query('...');
} finally {
  client.release();
}
```
2. Increase the database pool maximum capacity or set idle timeouts in connection pool configurations.

Use a useEffect hook to set a state variable (e.g. `isMounted = true`) and perform client-only rendering only after mounting:
```typescript
const [mounted, setMounted] = useState(false);
useEffect(() => {
  setMounted(true);
}, []);
if (!mounted) return null; // or loading spinner
